  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantLeaseholdsThatHaveBeenAcquiredOrGivenAssignedOrSurrenderedTextBlock id="Tag3887" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantLeaseholdsThatHaveBeenAcquiredOrGivenAssignedOrSurrenderedTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantExtensionOrReductionOfTransmissionOrDistributionSystemTextBlock id="Tag3888" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class="Normal"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;"&gt;Effective January 1, 2026, Choctaw Fields Solar Project, LLC, Guzman Energy LLC, Hope Water and Light Commission, Kiowa County Solar Project, LLC, Longview Infrastructure Southwest, LLC, Mewbourne Oil Company, and New Mexico Oil &amp;amp; Gas Association all became non-transmission owning members.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="Normal"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;"&gt;Effective March 1, 2026, Antora Energy, Inc. and GridStor became non-transmission owning members.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantExtensionOrReductionOfTransmissionOrDistributionSystemTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock id="Tag3889" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;"&gt;Southwest Power Pool (SPP) has a $150,000,000 revolving line of credit with a commercial bank expiring in 2033 &lt;em&gt;(Docket number ES25-33)&lt;/em&gt;. At March 31, 2026, $23,600,000 was borrowed against this line. The agreement has a variable interest rate based on the Daily Simple Secured Overnight Funding Rate (SOFR) index plus a credit margin that varies according to cash collateral provided to secure the loan. The margin applicable at March 31, 2026, was 2.80% resulting in an effective rate of 6.17%. The Company&amp;#8217;s line of credit requires compliance with certain financial and non-financial covenants as well as periodic reporting requirements. &lt;font style="mso-spacerun: yes;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: black;"&gt;SPP &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;"&gt;has a $30,000,000 revolving line of credit with a commercial bank expiring in 2027 &lt;em&gt;(Docket number ES25-51)&lt;/em&gt;. At March 31, 2026, $3,763,340 was borrowed against this line. The agreement has a variable interest rate based on the Daily Simple Secured Overnight Funding Rate (SOFR) index plus a 1.1% credit margin. The Company&amp;#8217;s line of credit requires compliance with certain financial and non-financial covenants as well as periodic reporting requirements.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-autospace: none;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: black;"&gt;SPP &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;"&gt;has an $80,000,000 revolving commitment from another commercial bank expiring in 2027 that could be utilized for both revolving and term loans &lt;em&gt;(Docket number ES22-33)&lt;/em&gt;. At March 31, 2026, $32,940,000 was outstanding against the revolving balance and $32,083,407 was outstanding against the term loan principal. The agreement has a revolving interest rate based on the Secured Overnight Funding Rate (SOFR) index plus a 1.5% credit margin, with a floor of 2.50%. The Company&amp;#8217;s line of credit requires compliance with certain financial and non-financial covenants as well as periodic reporting requirements.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInArticlesOfIncorporationOrAmendmentsToCharterTextBlock id="Tag3890" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInArticlesOfIncorporationOrAmendmentsToCharterTextBlock>
