    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value9" xlink:to="footnote9" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="9" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote10" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The Utility Plant (101-105, 114) total of $364,297,604 includes an operating lease/right of use (ROU) asset valued at $519,993. Following guidance from Accounting Inquiries at FERC, and due to the absence of a specific FERC code for operating leases, the code for capital leases was utilized and the necessary footnotes were provided. The operating lease is recorded in account 101.1. The non-current portion of the liability is in account 227.0 and the current portion of the liability is in account 243.0.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value10" xlink:to="footnote10" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="10" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote11" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The $566,914 represents the non-current portion of the operating lease liability associated with the right of use (ROU) asset. Following guidance from Accounting Inquiries at FERC, and due to the absence of a specific FERC code for operating leases, the code for capital leases was utilized and the necessary footnotes were provided. The operating lease asset is recorded in account 101.1. The non-current portion of the liability is in account 227.0 and the current portion of the liability is in account 243.0.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value11" xlink:to="footnote11" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="11" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote12" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The $29,170 represents the current portion of the operating lease liability associated with the right of use (ROU) asset. Following guidance from Accounting Inquiries at FERC, and due to the absence of a specific FERC code for operating leases, the code for capital leases was utilized and the necessary footnotes were provided. The operating lease asset is recorded in account 101.1. The non-current portion of the liability is in account 227.0 and the current portion of the liability is in account 243.0.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value12" xlink:to="footnote12" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="12" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote15" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;" border="0">
          <xhtml:tbody>
